ture BIM Engineers</p><h1 class=\"h1 ph-a\">Infrastructure BIM and <em>Civil 3D engineers.</em></h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Civil 3D specialists for roads, utilities and rail, coordinated with the buildings around them.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Infrastructure</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Infrastructure BIM Engineers placed onsite, remotely or as part of a dedicated team, <em>each one assessed before you meet them.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Infrastructure%20BIM%20Engineers\">Request Infrastructure BIM Engineers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Infrastructure BIM Engineer</li><li>Civil 3D Engineer</li><li>Roads BIM Modeler</li><li>Utilities BIM Engineer</li><li>Rail BIM Engineer</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Model alignments, profiles, corridors and grading in Civil 3D</li><li>Model pipe networks and utility corridors from survey data</li><li>Check utility crossings and interfaces with roads and structures</li><li>Extract quantities and produce plan-and-profile drawings</li><li>Federate infrastructure and building models through IFC and Navisworks</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Civil 3D</span><span>InfraWorks</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>AutoCAD</span><span>Revit</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class